    "text": "<p>Let GP&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>201</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>200</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>adding&nbsp;both,</p><p><math xmln